            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Jesus answered, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the Devil took him up and showed him in a second all the kingdoms of the world. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I will give you all this power and all this wealth,” the Devil told him. “It has all been handed over to me, and I can give it to anyone I choose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All this will be yours, then, if you worship me.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
