      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the Devil took him to Jerusalem and set him on the highest point of the Temple, and said to him, “If you are God's Son, throw yourself down from here. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.91.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ps 91.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the scripture says, ‘God will order his angels to take good care of you.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.91.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ps 91.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It also says, ‘They will hold you up with their hands so that not even your feet will be hurt on the stones.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
